    "body": "## Problem\n\nMissing `@param` annotations leave types as `any`/`unknown`.\n\n## Solution\n\nAdd missing annotations and fix minor issues they expose.\n\nKeep `incomplete-signature-doc` disabled: EmmyLua currently requires `@return` annotations and does not accept `@type` in place of `@param`.\n",
